---
import ProjectLayout from '../../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro';
import Earth from '../../components/react/Earth.jsx';
import '../../styles/project.css';
---
<ProjectLayout title="Designing the future of education" description="A major product iteration for Smart Sparrow, focused on becoming a powerful and approachable tool for learning designers." roles={['Art Direction','UX & UI Design','Front End Development','Motion Design']} background="/images/projects/smart-sparrow.jpg" accent="#8fe1ff">
  <section class="project-section"><div class="project-content"><div class="project-copy"><h2>The problem</h2><div class="prose"><p>Smart Sparrow set out to rebuild its authoring platform from the ground up. The previous Flash product had significant usability and collaboration barriers.</p><p>The new direction needed to welcome first-time educators while preserving the depth advanced learning designers depended on.</p></div></div><div class="project-media"><img src="/images/projects/smart-sparrow/builder.jpg" width="2560" height="1600" alt="The Smart Sparrow lesson builder." /></div></div></section>
  <section class="project-section" data-tone="soft"><div class="project-content"><div class="project-copy"><h2>A system built to scale</h2><div class="prose"><p>A shared design system brought consistency to complex authoring tools and gave engineers reusable foundations for new learning interactions.</p></div></div><div class="project-grid"><img src="/images/projects/smart-sparrow/design-system.png" width="2048" height="1600" loading="lazy" alt="Smart Sparrow design system patterns." /><img src="/images/projects/smart-sparrow/components.png" width="2048" height="1600" loading="lazy" alt="Smart Sparrow component library." /></div></div></section>
  <section class="project-section"><div class="project-content"><div class="project-copy"><h2>Learning without borders</h2><div class="prose"><p>The platform connected educators, designers, and learners across institutions. This lightweight globe represents the reach of those shared learning experiences.</p></div></div><div class="graphics-stage"><Earth client:visible /></div></div></section>
  <section class="project-section" data-tone="soft"><div class="project-content"><div class="project-copy"><h2>Motion with purpose</h2><div class="prose"><p>Motion clarified hierarchy and made direct manipulation feel responsive without getting in the way of authoring.</p></div></div><div class="project-media"><video controls preload="none" poster="/images/projects/smart-sparrow/motion-poster.jpg"><source src="/images/projects/smart-sparrow/motion.mp4" type="video/mp4" />Your browser does not support video.</video></div></div></section>
</ProjectLayout>
